<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <style>
      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #333; }
      .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
      .header { background: #ffc107; color: #333; padding: 20px; text-align: center; border-radius: 5px 5px 0 0; }
      .content { background: #f8f9fa; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #dee2e6; }
      .footer { background: #f8f9fa; padding: 10px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #6c757d; }
      .alert-box { background: #fff3cd; border: 1px solid #ffeeba; color: #856404; padding: 15px; border-radius: 5px; margin: 20px 0; }
      .metric { display: inline-block; width: 45%; margin: 10px 2.5%; padding: 10px; background: white; border: 1px solid #dee2e6; border-radius: 5px; text-align: center; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <h1>⚠ Stock Alert</h1>
      </div>
      
      <div class="content">
        <div class="alert-box">
          <h2 style="margin-top: 0;">Stock Below Threshold</h2>
          <p>A product in your inventory has fallen below the minimum threshold.</p>
        </div>
        
        <h2>Product Information</h2>
        <p><strong>Product SKU:</strong> {{productSku}}</p>
        <p><strong>Product Name:</strong> {{productName}}</p>
        
        <h2>Stock Details</h2>
        <div style="text-align: center;">
          <div class="metric">
            <div style="font-size: 24px; color: #dc3545; font-weight: bold;">{{currentStock}}</div>
            <div>Current Stock</div>
          </div>
          <div class="metric">
            <div style="font-size: 24px; color: #ffc107; font-weight: bold;">{{threshold}}</div>
            <div>Minimum Threshold</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <p><strong>Alert Time:</strong> {{alertDate}}</p>
        
        <h2>Action Required</h2>
        <p>Please review your inventory and consider placing a reorder to avoid stockouts. This product may need urgent restocking.</p>
        
        <p>Best regards,<br><strong>PureShop Inventory System</strong></p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="footer">
        <p>&copy; 2026 PureShop. All rights reserved.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        <p>&copy; 2024 YouShop. All rights reserved.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>